      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_02fa417e179f08c6250d6988_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Layout and Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "02fa417e179f08c6250d69887dcd52e1f8f14833b018e57ad8b69b9c23944235",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dd3631abb999bd82d8d4d99b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If a note or workspace is hoisted, a badge will appear on the left-most side.",
      "sourceHash": "dd3631abb999bd82d8d4d99b349203fc8a7cd6f1f2250199ba3c88c04d4ee077",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8ccc04da653d5a034c9937be_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on the badge will un-hoist the note/workspace.",
      "sourceHash": "8ccc04da653d5a034c9937befd12f5ad8db8cf9754d37239d26e0f21bc58d51f",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71d8e9f7d17a16aa4b4cc5c2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The left-most icon represents the root note, or the hoisted note or workspace.",
      "sourceHash": "71d8e9f7d17a16aa4b4cc5c20f3bf99e921e98214187b7cdbb4d8cfe67bb91bf",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9128d47be598a89044ec99b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking the icon will jump to the root note.",
      "sourceHash": "d9128d47be598a89044ec99bff7d25ccc9c6c8321053b25683877dffcabadc47",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ee8816a5f148d39481ccbf15_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right clicking the icon will display a menu that allows opening the note in a new tab, split, etc.",
      "sourceHash": "ee8816a5f148d39481ccbf153f16baf42bca66cb3c9fe5849fd55bb0c8f4ee52",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e882390a7f4518d878f46494_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each segment shows the title of a note in the current note hierarchy.",
      "sourceHash": "e882390a7f4518d878f46494b1ca7372ee89a1388927ce2218d2fb4036fec014",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7b815fdbb9c22aa56df51712_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking the icon will jump to that note.",
      "sourceHash": "7b815fdbb9c22aa56df5171220baab4a49b42ad483c292b249d8388c4467e645",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4218c23bb2dc8d9a870c4f98_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right clicking will open a menu with multiple options such as opening the note in a different tab/split/window, hoisting, moving/cloning the note, duplicating as well as changing the color of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "4218c23bb2dc8d9a870c4f98c16aa5b27b9abd2d51ab0938ab85c09bd4871f60",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0dd3fc6be054c6576367ca08_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking the arrow next to each segment will reveal the child notes of the segment on the left.",
      "sourceHash": "0dd3fc6be054c6576367ca08a2b5b655a59d7c98d10ca903af25afadf7c9502d",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ad2f0369f84a65eaba47246_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking on an icon will navigate to that particular note.",
      "sourceHash": "1ad2f0369f84a65eaba47246b52b61a97d14b40fd4fa72b14e19f0ef004264f3",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5e5313d9b8edbe74278cfb9a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To find a child note by its title, start typing: the field at the bottom of the menu filters the list.",
      "sourceHash": "5e5313d9b8edbe74278cfb9a47098e6eb7d63db1fade896506946d9fe426308b",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8a4a28959ddc085b475fc8be_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It's also possible to create a new child note from here.",
      "sourceHash": "8a4a28959ddc085b475fc8befb12229b036918860832b4d4a43c6c77c1dd6dee",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1c95a486d988b3097fcd98d8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The menu can optionally hide the archived notes.",
      "sourceHash": "1c95a486d988b3097fcd98d8cb4cc480c4397d41d105eae143ef4bbf8783d101",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1b149fb2548ba8c4a081c832_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the current note is deep within a hierarchy, the segments will collapse into a […] button in order not to occupy too much space.",
      "sourceHash": "1b149fb2548ba8c4a081c8326d8cc5761ed546d95bdf823e8158c2bfc9e52135",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d87f871a891d5c906702d463_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking this button will display each collapsed entry as a menu item. Clicking on it will navigate to that particular note.",
      "sourceHash": "d87f871a891d5c906702d463a498c7c274ff1d167f080428cceb379fb744d91c",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f0c4d99eae4d7c83107022e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right clicking on an empty space to the right of the breadcrumb (before the other status bar items) will reveal another menu that allows:",
      "sourceHash": "4f0c4d99eae4d7c83107022e9ede17dfd9930716a1318e4e756a37bea4e81f1f",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f276fb1178d2aac8ebbc5f51_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Toggling whether archived notes are displayed in the breadcrumb and in the note tree.",
      "sourceHash": "f276fb1178d2aac8ebbc5f51e92bd59be0e30de49b13c0c8a803ba615050a6cb",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f3548f8deb6aaf04182362d9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Copying the current note path to clipboard.",
      "sourceHash": "f3548f8deb6aaf04182362d94e7ed97012d3fa40c2f4681afd1e3e74890b5786",
      "context": "Breadcrumb > Layout and Interaction",
      "contextHash": "a7e926885ee4944b63856c5d075557351695aa1ca1c436c2e8b1a4d502d7b221",
      "status": "pending",
